When at the start of the instance, take the first left. Once you reach the Vine at the end, drop down below to where you see *Agam'ars* below \\ Kill the *Agam'ars* below with your party to create a clear space \\ Use the *Crate With Holes* to summon a *Snufflenose Gopher* at this location. Finding the correct spot to summon it can be finicky \\ Use the *Snufflenose Command Stick* to action the *Gopher* to dig up *Blueleaf Tubers* \\ Loot the *Blueleaf Tuber* once it has dug it up \\ Continue to use the *Snufflenose Command Stick* on it again so it digs up another one. Repeat this process until you have 6 *Blueleaf Tubers* \\ If your *Gopher* despawns, use the *Crate With Holes* to summon another. Note it only has 5 charges \\ [QC1221,1 Blueleaf Tubers][UI5880-][UI6684-]
